87e-4cce-4bba-a231-c7effa8d3b0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692544/4090087e-4cce-4bba-a231-c7effa8d3b0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692544/4090087e-4cce-4bba-a231-c7effa8d3b0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692544/4090087e-4cce-4bba-a231-c7effa8d3b0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692544/4090087e-4cce-4bba-a231-c7effa8d3b0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1692544/4090087e-4cce-4bba-a231-c7effa8d3b0e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Large 21m2 Room for 2 PEOPLE | Fully Furnished | All-Inclusive | Near Augsburg University & Munich | Couples/Colleagues\n\nROOM\nLooking for a place to share as a couple or with a colleague? Ideally located between Augsburg and Munich – perfect for two people wanting a stress-free, fully furnished base. Whether you're students at the University of Augsburg or THA, professionals at KUKA, MAN, Airbus, or commuting from Munich – just move in together and make yourselves at home.\n\n21 m2 room  →  370 € (All-Inclusive) pro PERSON!!\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────\nWhat's included in the rent?\n✔\tLarge, fully furnished room (21 m2) for 2 people (bed, wardrobe, desk, chair)\n✔\tBright & modern shared kitchen with ceramic hob, oven, microwave, fridge, cooking utensils\n✔\tHigh-speed WiFi – perfect for working from home or studying\n✔\tAll utilities included (heating, electricity, water) – no hidden costs!\n✔\tWashing machine available in the bathroom\n✔\tSeparate WC & bathroom with bathtub\n✔\tClean & well-maintained living environment\n✔\tSupermarkets (Kaufland, Lidl, DM) nearby\n─────────────────────────────────────────\nLOCATION\nPublic Transport:\n✔\tTram stop – 3 min walk\n✔\tAugsburg University: approx. 18 min by tram\n✔\tMunich: approx. 45 min via tram through Augsburg\n\nShops & Services Nearby:\n✔\tSupermarkets (Kaufland, Lidl, DM) – all walkable\n✔\tPharmacies & doctors – all within walking distance\n✔\tCafes, restaurants, bakeries & fitness studios close by\n─────────────────────────────────────────\nFLATMATE SITUATION\nWho is this room ideal for?\n✔\tCouples looking for a shared, hassle-free place to live\n✔\tWork colleagues based in the Augsburg/Munich area\n✔\tTwo friends wanting to split costs and share a room\n✔\tExpats & internationals are very welcome\n\nThis is not a party flat – quiet & respectful living expected.\n─────────────────────────────────────────\nINTERESTED?\nRoom available from May!\nSend us a short message with:\n✔\tYour names & backgrounds (students/professionals)\n✔\tYour planned move-in date & length of stay\n✔\tA little bit about yourselves\n─────────────────────────────────────────\nRequired Documents\nFor Working Professionals:\n✔\tTenant self-disclosure form (for both people)\n✔\tPayslips from the last 3 months\n✔\tCopy of Passport/ID (front & back)\n✔\tSchufa credit report\n\nFor Students:\n✔\tTenant self-disclosure form\n✔\tProof of financial support: parents' guarantee / BAfoeg / blocked account / scholarship\n✔\tCopy of student ID & enrollment certificate\n✔\tCopy of Passport/ID\n✔\tSchufa credit report (if available; otherwise guarantor's Schufa accepted)\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"va