l-maintained living environment\n\nThere’s no large shared living room, but the kitchen is a nice space for cooking and casual chats.\n\nPublic Transport:\nTrain Stop \"Augsburger Straße\" – 3 min walk\nAugsburg City Center: 15-20 min by train\nDirect Train Line 3 to Augsburg Hbf\nUniversity of Augsburg, Innovationspark, BBW für Physik, : 20 min away\n\nShops & Services Nearby:\n\nSupermarkets (REWE, Edeka, Lidl, DM) – all within walking distance\nCafés, restaurants, and bakeries close by\nFitness studios & parks for exercise and relaxation\n\nInterested? Send me a short message with:\n✔ Your name & background (student/professional)\n✔ Your planned move-in date & duration of stay\n✔ A little bit about yourself","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"15"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"no"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"94"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":68000,"deposit":20000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0}